    "text": "By Lillian Kosh ,\n1 days ago COLLEGE STATION, Texas (KBTX) - At a special College Station city council meeting on Monday, members discussed a new proposal to place a multi-event center in Hensel Park, combining convention space with athletics, concerts, and community events. This comes after years of brainstorming ideas to revitalize Hensel Park. In February,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
